+When the Agent owner prepares an existing Session for live resume, its JSONL write handle publishes a durable version-1 observation receipt in its writer-owned directory. The live Session exposes the receipt through `observationRecovery` after normal resume preparation. The receipt identifies the writer epoch, its exact durable recovered prefix, and up to 128 earlier owners. Observer reloads leave the writer epoch unchanged. The receipt is separate from the session format. An absent or unverified receipt provides no observation continuity; a receipt failure leaves ordinary session reads and writes available.
